1
00:01:57,640 --> 00:01:59,200
Looks like human bones were dug up.

2
00:02:11,740 --> 00:02:15,620
=Medical Examiner Dr. Qin: Bones of the Past=
=Episode 1=

3
00:02:34,680 --> 00:02:35,840
The dorsal rim of the pubic symphysis

4
00:02:35,840 --> 00:02:37,150
has formed and become prominent.

5
00:02:37,470 --> 00:02:38,680
The ventral rim
shows signs of degeneration.

6
00:02:38,680 --> 00:02:40,240
Combined with the condition
of the auricular surface,

7
00:02:40,240 --> 00:02:41,190
the deceased was female,

8
00:02:41,400 --> 00:02:43,030
approximately 35 years old.

9
00:02:44,080 --> 00:02:45,430
Her pelvis shows evidence of childbirth.

10
00:02:45,630 --> 00:02:46,520
She had given birth

11
00:02:46,750 --> 00:02:47,910
to at least one child.

12
00:02:49,030 --> 00:02:50,800
The sternum near the heart
shows signs of repeated cutting

13
00:02:50,800 --> 00:02:52,560
with a sharp instrument,
leaving parallel incisions.

14
00:02:52,710 --> 00:02:54,360
The cut surfaces
of the bone are flat and smooth.

15
00:02:54,360 --> 00:02:56,190
They appear to be tool marks left behind

16
00:02:56,190 --> 00:02:57,430
after the chest was cut open
and the heart removed.

17
00:02:57,470 --> 00:02:58,280
Her heart

18
00:02:59,240 --> 00:03:00,910
was most likely removed.

19
00:03:11,280 --> 00:03:12,630
There are multiple
comminuted fractures of the skull,

20
00:03:13,150 --> 00:03:13,910
concentrated at the top.

21
00:03:13,910 --> 00:03:15,260
Note the direction
of these fracture lines

22
00:03:15,260 --> 00:03:16,250
and the order in which they overlap.

23
00:03:16,310 --> 00:03:18,160
The wounds are consistent in shape.

24
00:03:18,280 --> 00:03:19,960
They're all roughly circular depressions

25
00:03:19,960 --> 00:03:21,280
with radiating fractures.

26
00:03:21,280 --> 00:03:23,490
They were caused by blows
from the same type of round,

27
00:03:23,490 --> 00:03:24,530
hammer-like object.

28
00:03:30,100 --> 00:03:31,900
Based on where the major
fracture lines terminate

29
00:03:32,140 --> 00:03:33,620
and how the wounds overlap,

30
00:03:34,340 --> 00:03:35,580
the victim sustained

31
00:03:35,780 --> 00:03:37,220
at least ten such fatal blows.

32
00:03:37,940 --> 00:03:39,260
Every blow
was delivered with full force.

33
00:03:41,340 --> 00:03:42,475
(Chen Shiyu, Medical Examiner)
You can hardly

34
00:03:42,475 --> 00:03:43,580
(of Longfan City Public Security Bureau)
even call this murder.

35
00:03:43,580 --> 00:03:44,780
This was a sadistic killing.

36
00:03:44,900 --> 00:03:47,260
(Qin Ming, Medical Examiner
of Longfan City Public Security Bureau)

37
00:03:47,260 --> 00:03:48,380
Based on the erosion of the bones

38
00:03:48,540 --> 00:03:50,380
and the degree of collagen loss,

39
00:03:51,020 --> 00:03:52,980
the remains were likely
buried about 30 years ago.

40
00:03:54,020 --> 00:03:57,420
30 years ago would put it in 1990.

41
00:03:59,460 --> 00:04:00,980
I'll run a DNA test first

42
00:04:00,980 --> 00:04:02,300
and see if we can identify her.

43
00:04:14,620 --> 00:04:15,900
